p of easy to remember words\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference describes a group of easy to remember words, not letters.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-003\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a binary seed.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference says a binary seed, not an ASCII seed.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"This seed can later be used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"This BIP falls under the GPL License.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-006\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"A mnemonic code or sentence is superior for human interaction compared to the handling of raw binary or hexadecimal representations of a wallet seed.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference refers to a wallet seed, not wallet satoshis.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The sentence could be written on paper\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states the sentence could be written on paper.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"spoken over the telephone\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states the sentence could be spoken over the telephone.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-009\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated randomness with a human-readable transcription.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference says computer-generated randomness, not determinism.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet seed.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The claim matches the reference; süeed is a typo for seed.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets)\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states user-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"The mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference says a multiple of 32 bits, not 23 bits.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"With more entropy security is improved\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"but the sentence length increases\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states that with more entropy the sentence length increases.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"We refer to the initial entropy length as ENT.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"The allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference gives 128-256 bits, not 1024-2048 bytes.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-007\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA256 hash.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference names SHA256, not SHA652.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-008\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"This checksum is appended to the end of the initial entropy.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference says the checksum is appended to the end, not the start.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-009\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"these concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference says groups of 11 bits, not 12 bits.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"each encoding a number from 0-2047\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"serving as an index into a wordlist\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Finally, we convert these numbers into words\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"use the joined words as a mnemonic sentence\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"CS = ENT / 32\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference formula states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"MS = (ENT + CS) / 11\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference formula states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The table row matches all values.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The table row matches all values.\"},{\"